<PageTitle>PdfEdit for the web</PageTitle>

<h1>PdfEdit for the web</h1>

<p>An early web version of PdfEdit, built on the same libraries as the Windows app:
    <strong>PdfEdit.Core</strong> reads and fills PDF forms, and <strong>PdfEdit.Render</strong>
    draws the pages with Pdfium.</p>

<p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="fill">Fill a form</a></p>
